  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Process facilitator for an effective and coherent BHO water programming for 2026 - 2030, with broad support from the Dutch water community.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The water team of the Inclusive Green Growth Department (IGG) seeks support from an external process facilitator to develop coherent and effective water programming for 2026 - 2030, with broad support of, and in cooperation with, the Dutch water community. The process facilitator will prepare - in close collaboration with the IGG water team - and facilitate a series of dialogues between the water team and relevant stakeholders. The focus of the dialogues is strengthened cooperation with and across the Dutch water community, the role of the Netherlands Water Partnership (NWP) as a branch organisation, and opportunities to enhance effective international water cooperation and contribute to Dutch trade and economy interest using the Partners for Water (PvW) Programme as a possible channel. Ultimately, the dialogues should result in better mutual understanding, broad support, a shared framework with clear goals, priorities, roles and next steps for all stakeholders involved.</narrative>
  </description>
